{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04923","headline":"九日幸临渭亭登高应制得开字 · 卢藏用","name":"九日幸临渭亭登高应制得开字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上月重阳满，中天万乘来。\n萸依佩里发，菊向酒边开。\n圣泽烟云动，宸文象纬回。\n小臣无以荅，愿奉亿千杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢藏用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}